data: {"id": "157685349b494b1b-final", "run_id": "157685349b494b1b", "seq": 1204, "ts_ms": 1788803554031, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | Running | Pod aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr 状态 Running 但容器 app 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，连续重启 18 次 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason`: \"OOMKilled\", `last_exit_code`: 137 (`fact-1e32b3011f46`, `fact-2904f96fc92e`) | 直接确认最后一次终止是由系统 OOM 机制触发 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory`: 64Mi, `resource_request.memory`: 24Mi (`fact-67c7654222e6`, `fact-047988178b05`) | 确认容器硬内存限制为 64Mi，资源配置较低 |\n| 3 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `allocated_mib` 从 4Mi 增长至 46Mi，且出现 8 次相同模式 (`fact-logging-pattern-1`) | 揭示应用存在内存增长行为，逼近并可能超出 64Mi 限制 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Tempo | Span `fb24dc3f...` 属性标记 `aiops.observed_mode: oom_growth` (`fact-4530b28bad85`) | 关联应用调用与 OOM 增长模式，排除外部流量突发因素 |\n\n**证据关联说明**：Kubernetes 明确显示 `OOMKilled` 是终止原因（#1）；日志中应用内存从 4Mi 增长至 46Mi（#3），结合 64Mi 的硬限制（#2），证实内存持续增长的逻辑与 OOM 触发一致；Trace 数据（#4）进一步印证了内存增长的应用侧行为。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存限制为 64Mi → 应用运行内存持续增长逼近并触发限制导致 OOMKilled (Exit 137) → Kubernetes 终止容器并进入 CrashLoopBackOff → Pod 状态 Running 但容器不 Ready\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n根因是**应用内存增长超出限制**。证据显示：应用容器内存使用量在最近日志中已达到 46Mi（`fact-logging-pattern-1`），而容器的硬内存限制仅为 64Mi（`fact-67c7654222e6`）。Kubernetes 记录的最后终止原因为 `OOMKilled`（`fact-1e32b3011f46`），这与应用内存持续增长且接近配置上限的行为完全吻合。虽然未能获取完整的工作集内存趋势（如 `container_memory_working_set_bytes` 历史数据），但现有日志内存分配增长事实与 OOMKilled 状态足以支撑该结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 114.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 114.3s (Evidence 106.8s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-evicted\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 142.833, "metrics": {"run_id": "157685349b494b1b", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 142.84091329574585, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-evicted, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 142840.91329574585, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 115123.1107711792, "tool_calls": 24, "executed_tool_calls": 21, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 6, "tool_duration_ms": 56028.78212928772, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 27208.68158340454}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 18997.124433517456, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 114303.60221862793, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9516.748189926147, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

